※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4696 LANG_SINGLETON_CHANGES

※ A singleton is read-only, so a type with a field written where its record is not
※ cannot be one.

let std := ⎕import("std")

type Counter = mut n : u8 ; singleton zero : Counter = Counter(.n ← 0u8)

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    0u6
